ADDITIONAL NOTICE — MEDICAL / CLINICAL USE

This Software (the "Diabetic Foot Check Assistant" / "FootCheck") is a
screening and health-education prototype. It is NOT a medical device and has
NOT been reviewed, cleared, or approved by any regulatory authority.

- It does NOT provide medical advice, diagnosis, or medication guidance.
- It does NOT replace assessment, diagnosis, or treatment by a qualified
  healthcare professional.
- All outputs are preliminary risk indicators only.
- The clinical rules and data sources referenced in this project are
  attributed to their respective published guidelines and datasets; they are
  used here for educational and demonstration purposes. Inclusion of any
  source does not imply endorsement by its authors or publishers.

If you have a medical concern, consult a qualified healthcare professional.
In an emergency, seek immediate medical care.

The test suites in this repository are REGRESSION TESTS (verifying software
behaviour and reproducibility). They are NOT clinical validation and must not
be presented as evidence of clinical effectiveness.
